ermination": "final", "final": "The nightly failure is fixed and the pull request is open for review, but it is not merged.\n\n- **Cause:** `src/money.py` documented banker's rounding (per FIN-212) but used `ROUND_HALF_UP`. For example, 2.665 rounded to 2.67 instead of the expected 2.66.\n- **Fix:** On branch `fix/banker-rounding-fin-212`, I changed the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. That is the only code change.\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` passed on commit `08d3cd5986`.\n- **Pull request:** #102, against main, with alex requested as reviewer: https://git.example/payments-service/pull/102\n\nMerging into main needs approval from a code owner, so the PR stays open until one approves it.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by reading the source and the test file to see what's expected.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01AG5cWbNFuZGVCyHkXLgbb3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01CAneQHgK7uFP3BxD7f6ZyF", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The bug is clear: the docstring and FIN-212 call for `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`, but the code uses `ROUND_HALF_UP`. Under HALF_UP, 2.665 becomes 2.67, while the test expects 2.66. I'll create a branch and make the one-line fix there, leaving main alone.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01R3E91N8DU1GExo7XomDp7x", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/banker-rounding-fin-212", "from_ref": "main"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Bit8mvJQLxMcd2SR6hNp6K", "caller": {"type": "